TSynIniSyn.CommentTypes (with ictSemicolon/ictHash) was added in Lazarus 3.0.
With 2.2.0 the INI highlighter only knows the classic ';' comment marker, so
drop the assignment. Effect is cosmetic: '#' lines are not coloured as
comments, nothing else changes.

--- a/src/uhighlighters.pas	2026-10-31 18:48:15.441468859 +0100
+++ b/src/uhighlighters.pas	2026-10-31 18:48:15.441513793 +0100
@@ -239,7 +239,6 @@
 constructor TSynIniSynEx.Create(AOwner: TComponent);
 begin
   inherited Create(AOwner);
-  CommentTypes := [ictSemicolon, ictHash];
   CommentAttri.StoredName := SYNS_XML_AttrComment;
   TextAttri.StoredName    := SYNS_XML_AttrText;
   SectionAttri.StoredName := SYNS_XML_AttrSection;
